        <mxCell id="pg20_tbl" value="외부 API&#10;· JustTCG: https://api.justtcg.com/v1 (games, sets, cards) — PriceService&#10;· PSA Public API: https://api.psacard.com/publicapi — PsaPublicApiService (토큰 시)&#10;· Pinata: SDK upload.public.file / 메타 JSON&#10;&#10;온체인 (wagmi write/read)&#10;· Tokenable_RWA: mint, approve&#10;· USDC: approve, balanceOf&#10;· Seaport: getCounter, fulfillOrder&#10;· 지갑: signTypedData (Seaport + CollectionBid)&#10;&#10;백엔드 HTTP (일부)&#10;· POST /psa/analyze&#10;· POST /rwa/upload&#10;· POST /marketplace/orders&#10;· GET /marketplace/orders, /orders/:hash&#10;· PATCH .../cancel, .../fulfill&#10;· POST /bucket-bids, .../prepare-fulfill, .../validate-seller&#10;· GET /blockchain/rwa/*&#10;· GET /price/cards (프론트 직접도 가능)&#10;&#10;OCR&#10;· Tesseract.js (서버 psa.service.ts)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#fafafa;fontFamily=Lucida Console;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
